<title>USA: US meat production 14.2 pct below week ago-USDA.</title>
<headline>US meat production 14.2 pct below week ago-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Nov 30 fell 14.2 pct at 708.3 min lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2  LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>30-Nov-96	410.1     5.3	 288.5	4.4	708.3</p>
<p>23-Nov-96	462.8     7.0	 350.5	5.0	825.3</p>
<p>Change:	  -11.4%  -24.3%	-17.7%   -12.0%     -14.2%</p>
<p>02-Dec-95	461.6     6.4	 373.3	5.5	846.8</p>
<p>Change:	  -11.2%  -17.2%	-22.7%   -20.0%     -16.4%</p>
<p>1996 YTD:    23024.8   324.3     15364.2    236.1    38949.4</p>
<p>1995 YTD:    22779.6   274.2     16102.2    254.2    39410.2</p>
<p>Change:	    1.1%   18.3%	 -4.6%    -7.1%	-1.2%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>30-Nov-96     597,000	   26,000     1,539,000	69,000</p>
<p>23-Nov-96     671,000	   34,000     1,882,000	79,000</p>
<p>Change:	 -11.0%	   -23.5%	  -18.2%	-12.7%</p>
<p>02-Dec-95     658,000	   32,000     1,994,000	87,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -9.3%	   -18.8%	  -22.8%	-20.7%</p>
<p>1996 YTD:  32,857,000	1,559,000    83,059,000   3,691,000</p>
<p>1995 YTD:*  32,285,000	1,275,000    86,886,000   4,050,000</p>
<p>Change:	   1.8%	    22.3%	   -4.4%	 -8.9%</p>
<p>*1995 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
